      "name": "Can you clean garments labelled dry clean only?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Modern professional wet cleaning uses precisely controlled water temperature, gentle biodegradable detergents, and hand finishing to safely clean most garments labelled dry clean only, including wool, silk, and cashmere."
